    "title": "Survivor 50 Pre-Season Stats - Stephenie LaGrossa Kendrick - Inside Survivor",
    "text": "In the countdown to the Survivor 50: In the Hands of the Fans premiere on Wednesday, February 25, Inside Survivor’s Rob Brodeur will be posting a history of stats for each of the 24 returning castaways. Today, we are looking at Survivor: Palau, Survivor: Guatemala, and Survivor: Heroes vs. Villains castaway, Stephanie LaGrossa Kendrick. Stephenie LaGrossa Kendrick Original season: Palau (7th Place) Returning seasons: Guatemala (Runner-Up), Heroes vs. Villains (19th Place) Other reality show appearances: The Traitors season 1 (7th Place), Snake in the Grass (Exposed as the snake) Age on original season: 24 Age on In the Hands of the Fans: 46 Stephenie was the only Ulong member on Palau to be a member of the jury. Stephenie eliminated every member of her original starting tribe. She was the first person to do this and the second overall after Cochran in South Pacific. She’s the first player to win a firemaking challenge at tribal council. Stephenie is one of 3 players to play 3 times and never be on the same starting tribe as the season’s eventual winner (Jeff Varner & Aubry are the other two) Palau: Stephenie started on Ulong, Tom started on Koror. Guatemala: Stephenie started on Yaxha, Danni started on Nakhum. Heroes vs. Villains: Stephenie started on Heroes, Sandra started on Villains. Stephenie is the only player to be on more than one tribe on Palau. She’s tied with Jefra (Cagayan), Emily (Survivor 45), & Mary (Survivor 48) as the lowest placing player to be the highest ranking member of an original starting tribe. All 4 of them finished in 7th place. Stephenie is the only one to outlast more than 5 people, as Jefra, Emily, & Mary started on a 6-person tribe. Stephenie is the only woman to return on a season with 1 returning player on a tribe of new players. Bobby Jon in Guatemala Rob & Russell in Redemption Island Ozzy & Coach in South Pacific Skupin, Russell, & Penner on Philippines Bruce in Survivor 44 Stephenie and Colby have started on the same starting tribe twice, Heroes & Vatu. Prior to this season, Stephenie has only been on blue starting tribes. This is her first season not on a blue starting tribe. Palau: Ulong Guatemala: Yaxha Heroes vs. Villains: Heroes She’s the first player to be on the same starting tribe color in three different seasons. Stephenie was the first player to be the highest ranking member of her tribe in two different seasons. She was the highest ranking member of Ulong in Palau & Yaxha in Guatemala. Sandra, Ozzy, Tony, & Natalie A also share this distinction. Stephenie & Cirie were both on season 1 of Traitors. Parvati, Sandra, Tony, Rob, Jeremy, & Carolyn have also been on Traitors. Cirie has been on a season of Survivor with all of them except for Jeremy & Carolyn. Natalie Anderson, Rob Cesternino, & Yam Yam are on season 4 of Traitors (currently airing). Written by",
